# Build context for Dockerfile.recovery-agent / Dockerfile.halden-desk.
# The images run the two Sanning demo examples from source with
# --conditions=intx-src, so the whole workspace ships — minus anything
# heavy, generated, or machine-local. bun install runs inside the image;
# runtime config (keys, ports, passcodes) comes from the deploy
# environment, never from baked-in .env files.
.git
.githooks
.claude
node_modules
**/node_modules
tmp
**/tmp
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.tap
.eslintcache
.DS_Store
keypairs
dispatch
Dockerfile.*
.dockerignore

# env files are machine-local secrets; the *.example files stay as docs
.env
.env.*
**/.env
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
